<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saturday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				Buying rate	 Selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   41.40		 41.50</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	69.60		 69.70</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 23.20		 23.25</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.362		 0.364</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.02		 11.04</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.27		 11.29</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.11		  1.13</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 2.20 pct	    2.40 pct</p>
</text>
